    "description": "Now unlocated, Prosymna was an ancient place in the Argolid. The Argive Heraion was located in its territory, at least according to Strabo. The nature of Prosymna as a place is unclear on the basis of the textual sources - whether it was a localized center or an area remains an unresolved issue.",
    "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: below Argive Heraion</p>",
